{
    "name": "§eFrank Bowers",
    "entityType": "easy_npc:humanoid",
    "description": "A local drug dealer with a soft spot for dogs.",
    "skin": {
        "type": "CUSTOM",
        "textureId": "Frank_Bowers_024879d0"
    },
    "attributes": {
        "maxHealth": 40,
        "invulnerable": false,
        "attackableByPlayers": true,
        "attackableByMonsters": true,
        "nameVisibility": "NEVER"
    },
    "dialogs": {
        "main": {
            "greeting": "嘿，新面孔。别靠太近，我和学校的人没什么好聊的。除非你是来买货的... 但我看你不像是那种人。",
            "buttons": [
                {
                    "label": "§6§l接受任务",
                    "action": "OPEN_QUEST_DIALOG:RANDOM_POOL:35869609-7e29-4d1f-b6fd-a56c73e571ca,4f91f07d-a2af-4ba7-8e72-fd5681bc860d,14278403-a141-405c-ba18-860b805de901,a76b6da6-7294-4189-98eb-5068c114dd4d,bd97288e-98ba-48eb-9642-513cacfae3d4",
                    "id": "btn_quest_6a67b9c2"
                },
                {
                    "label": "你的狗很可爱",
                    "action": "SHOW_DIALOG:talk_dog",
                    "id": "btn_dog"
                },
                {
                    "label": "听说你知道很多事",
                    "action": "SHOW_DIALOG:talk_info",
                    "id": "btn_info"
                },
                {
                    "label": "这把刀看起来很旧",
                    "action": "SHOW_DIALOG:quest_hook",
                    "id": "btn_quest"
                }
            ]
        },
        "talk_dog": {
            "greeting": "你是说邦妮？她是我的一切。比这镇上的所有人都强。如果你敢动她一根毫毛，我会让你后悔出生。懂吗？",
            "buttons": [
                {
                    "label": "我只是喜欢狗",
                    "action": "SHOW_DIALOG:talk_dog_2",
                    "id": "btn_like"
                },
                {
                    "label": "明白了",
                    "action": "SHOW_DIALOG:main",
                    "id": "btn_back"
                }
            ]
        },
        "talk_dog_2": {
            "greeting": "哼，那还差不多。她以前是Rachel的狗... 在Rachel失踪前。她总是给邦妮带好吃的。现在我只能自己照顾它了。",
            "buttons": [
                {
                    "label": "Rachel... 你很想她？",
                    "action": "CLOSE_DIALOG",
                    "id": "btn_close"
                }
            ]
        },
        "talk_info": {
            "greeting": "消息是有价的，小子。我可不是什么八卦专栏。但我确实有些渠道。你想知道什么？杰斐逊的真面目？还是那个总是盯着你看的维多利亚？",
            "buttons": [
                {
                    "label": "关于杰斐逊",
                    "action": "SHOW_DIALOG:talk_jefferson",
                    "id": "btn_jefferson"
                },
                {
                    "label": "没什么，我走了",
                    "action": "CLOSE_DIALOG",
                    "id": "btn_leave"
                }
            ]
        },
        "talk_jefferson": {
            "greeting": "那家伙... 完美得不像真人。我听说他在旧金山惹过麻烦才躲到这鬼地方的。如果你要调查他，最好小心点。我虽然不是什么好人，但我讨厌恋童癖。",
            "buttons": [
                {
                    "label": "你有证据吗？",
                    "action": "CLOSE_DIALOG",
                    "id": "btn_close"
                }
            ]
        },
        "quest_hook": {
            "greeting": "这把刀？这是我父亲留给我的。等等... 刀柄上的刻字磨损了。该死，我把它弄花了。我记得Rachel以前喜欢这种老式花纹，她帮我设计过一个。",
            "buttons": [
                {
                    "label": "也许我能帮你修复",
                    "action": "SHOW_DIALOG:quest_accept",
                    "id": "btn_repair"
                },
                {
                    "label": "看着挺一般的",
                    "action": "CLOSE_DIALOG",
                    "id": "btn_insult"
                }
            ]
        },
        "quest_accept": {
            "greeting": "你？你会这手艺？好吧，如果你能帮我恢复那个花纹，我就告诉你一个关于Vortex俱乐部的秘密。别让我失望，不然邦妮会不高兴的。",
            "buttons": [
                {
                    "label": "接受任务 (修复花纹)",
                    "action": "CLOSE_DIALOG",
                    "id": "btn_complete"
                }
            ]
        }
    },
    "pose": "STANDING",
    "drop": {
        "item": {
            "item": "numismatic-overhaul:bronze_coin,numismatic-overhaul:silver_coin",
            "count": 15
        },
        "minCount": 15,
        "maxCount": 30,
        "chance": 0.5,
        "playerKillOnly": true
    },
    "objectives": {
        "attackHostileMobs": true,
        "attackPlayers": false,
        "wanderRange": 50.0,
        "returnToSpawn": false
    }
}